WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:00.850
[He puoro piana me te puoru mahana]

00:00.850 --> 00:02.318
Ka tae mai i tēnei ngahuru.

00:04.400 --> 00:06.796
E mōhio ana ia ki te pai o ngā mahi a te tamaiti.

00:08.400 --> 00:10.542
E mōhio ana ia ki ngā wawata o te tamaiti.

00:14.250 --> 00:16.160
E mōhio ana ia ki te ingoa o te tamaiti.

00:19.200 --> 00:22.236
Tūtaki ki a Hana Kōkō i tētahi ara hou.

00:23.000 --> 00:26.000
[He tangi pere mārie. He pere reti hukarere.]
